# GoHighLevel (server-only). Copy to .env.local and fill in real values.
# In production (Vercel), add these under Project Settings → Environment Variables.
#
# The contact form works out of the box: both webhook URLs have baked-in
# defaults (the location's workflow webhook triggers) that fire the contact +
# SMS/consent automations with no config. Set the vars below only to override
# those defaults or to additionally enrich contacts via the GHL REST API
# (optional). Every submit fans out to BOTH webhook URLs.
GHL_TOKEN=your-ghl-private-integration-token
GHL_LOCATION_ID=your-ghl-location-id
GHL_MAIN_WEBHOOK_URL=your-contact-webhook-trigger-url
GHL_SMS_WEBHOOK_URL=your-sms-webhook-trigger-url
